    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just want to fix me so i can go back to being a productive person in a world that doesn't even feel real. but what if the unreality is the truth? what if the 'real' world is just more noise and more emptiness? sometimes it feels like the most honest thing i could do is just stop fighting the feeling... to just let go and stop trying to pretend i'm part of it. wouldn't it be more peaceful to just... not be a part of the simulation anymore?",
